# native/hostd/Dockerfile's own ignore file: Docker uses
# <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore INSTEAD of the repository's .dockerignore
# for this build. The Dockerfile copies native/ and nothing else, so
# everything else is excluded, and native/'s own build output and any
# credential-shaped file with it.
*
!native/
native/target/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
